.claude/settings.local.json
# `var/*`, not `var/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is
# excluded, so the two negations below would silently do nothing.
var/*
# Two exceptions, and they are the same exception twice: neither of these can be
# regenerated from the repository. `golden-set.json` is human judgement, and the
# only copy of it that survives `docker compose down -v`. `baseline.json` is the
# measurement every later Phase 2 milestone reports its diff against — a
# baseline that lives only on one machine is not a baseline.
!var/golden-set.json
!var/baseline.json

# Web
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
